  · exact absurd e (ch_ne_of ht1 hd1 (by simp [fT1_0]) (by simp [fT1_2]) (by simp only [Blk.pos, fT1_0, Dom, Hx, Rh] <;> omega) (by simp only [Blk.pos, fT1_2, Dom, Hx, Rh] <;> omega) (by simp [fT1_0, fT1_2]) (by simp only [Tr, fT1_0, fT1_2]; rintro ⟨h1, h2⟩; simp only [fT1_0, fT1_2, Blk.pos, Prod.ext_iff, OnD] at h1 h2 <;> omega) (by simp [Tr, fT1_0, fT1_2]))
